{"lines": [{"start": 3, "end": 121, "text": "Before AI touches your resume, ask for 3 lists.", "words": [{"w": "Before", "s": 6, "e": 16}, {"w": "AI", "s": 21, "e": 29}, {"w": "touches", "s": 32, "e": 43}, {"w": "your", "s": 44, "e": 47}, {"w": "resume,", "s": 49, "e": 62}, {"w": "ask", "s": 76, "e": 84}, {"w": "for", "s": 85, "e": 88}, {"w": "3", "s": 92, "e": 100}, {"w": "lists.", "s": 103, "e": 115}]}, {"start": 130, "end": 338, "text": "Skip that, and \"ran the café's Instagram\" turns into \"spearheaded a cross-channel brand strategy.\"", "words": [{"w": "Skip", "s": 134, "e": 141}, {"w": "that,", "s": 143, "e": 153}, {"w": "and", "s": 161, "e": 168}, {"w": "\"ran", "s": 177, "e": 185}, {"w": "the", "s": 186, "e": 188}, {"w": "café's", "s": 190, "e": 203}, {"w": "Instagram\"", "s": 206, "e": 224}, {"w": "turns", "s": 231, "e": 239}, {"w": "into", "s": 240, "e": 249}, {"w": "\"spearheaded", "s": 258, "e": 278}, {"w": "a", "s": 280, "e": 282}, {"w": "cross-channel", "s": 284, "e": 303}, {"w": "brand", "s": 308, "e": 315}, {"w": "strategy.\"", "s": 318, "e": 333}]}, {"start": 347, "end": 473, "text": "Sounds nothing like you. And you'll have to explain it in the interview.", "words": [{"w": "Sounds", "s": 352, "e": 360}, {"w": "nothing", "s": 367, "e": 377}, {"w": "like", "s": 379, "e": 385}, {"w": "you.", "s": 387, "e": 391}, {"w": "And", "s": 408, "e": 414}, {"w": "you'll", "s": 415, "e": 420}, {"w": "have", "s": 422, "e": 428}, {"w": "to", "s": 429, "e": 431}, {"w": "explain", "s": 432, "e": 445}, {"w": "it", "s": 446, "e": 448}, {"w": "in", "s": 450, "e": 451}, {"w": "the", "s": 453, "e": 455}, {"w": "interview.", "s": 456, "e": 469}]}, {"start": 482, "end": 638, "text": "So paste two things. The job posting, in full. Then your resume.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 486, "e": 490}, {"w": "paste", "s": 495, "e": 504}, {"w": "two", "s": 510, "e": 514}, {"w": "things.", "s": 516, "e": 528}, {"w": "The", "s": 540, "e": 543}, {"w": "job", "s": 545, "e": 551}, {"w": "